P1 TIA known positive/negative 100nA current calibration
.include ../models/p1_opamp.lib
Vcc vcc 0 5
Vmid vmid 0 2.5
* A current source leaving the WE node yields POSITIVE output relative to vmid.
Itest we 0 PWL(0 0 0.1 0 0.10001 100n 0.3 100n 0.30001 -100n 0.5 -100n)
Xtia vmid we vcc 0 tia P1_OP
Rf tia we 1Meg
Cf tia we 100p
Rfilter tia adc 1k
Cfilter adc 0 1u
.options plotwinsize=0
.tran 0 0.5 0 10u
.save V(we) V(tia) V(adc) V(vmid)
.meas tran out_positive AVG V(tia) FROM=0.25 TO=0.29
.meas tran out_negative AVG V(tia) FROM=0.45 TO=0.49
.meas tran transimpedance PARAM (out_positive-out_negative)/200n
.end
